2026-07-27T11:33:02.9783989Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T11:33:02.9784744Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T11:33:02.9785316Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T11:33:02.9786387Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T11:33:02.9787141Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
